@YarpApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:7000

### ============================================
### API GATEWAY - Point d'entrée unique
### ============================================
### Toutes les requêtes passent maintenant par le Gateway (port 7000)
### Au lieu d'appeler directement les services (5050, 5051, 5178)

### ============================================
### CATALOG SERVICE
### ============================================
### ❌ Ancien : http://localhost:5050/Products
### ✅ Nouveau : http://localhost:7000/catalog-service/Products

### Get all products
GET {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/catalog-service/Products
Accept: application/json

### Get product by ID
GET {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/catalog-service/Products/{productId}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### BASKET SERVICE
### ============================================
### ❌ Ancien : http://localhost:5051/Baskets/swn
### ✅ Nouveau : http://localhost:7000/basket-service/Baskets/swn

### Get basket by username
GET {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/basket-service/Baskets/swn
Accept: application/json

### Create/Update basket
POST {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/basket-service/Baskets/swn
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### ORDERING SERVICE
### ============================================
### ❌ Ancien : http://localhost:5178/Orders
### ✅ Nouveau : http://localhost:7000/ordering-service/Orders

### Get all orders
GET {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/ordering-service/Orders
Accept: application/json

### Get orders by customer ID
GET {{YarpApiGateway_HostAddress}}/ordering-service/Orders/customer/{customerId}
Accept: application/json

###
